            <sparkle:version>219</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.9.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <description><![CDATA[<h3>New</h3>
<ul>
<li>Codex CLI, Gemini CLI and OpenCode sessions show in the Agents tab next to Claude Code, Copilot CLI and Antigravity, read from their own files with no setup.</li>
<li>Release radar: a short peek when a tool you use ships a new version, and a "What's new" card in Usage with its top changes until you dismiss it. Checked every 6 hours.</li>
<li>Update on a release card runs that tool's own update command in a new Terminal window.</li>
<li>MCP health: one line under your sessions says how many MCP servers your agents use and which one is failing ("figma failed 3x in web-shop"). Click it for every server, what calls it and its most-used tools.</li>
<li>Builds you make yourself show an orange line under the notch and an orange menu bar icon, so you can tell them from the release.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
